  "wikitext": "{|class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\"\n|'''Cost''' || $450, 300x [[rubber]], 150x [[steel]]\n|-\n|'''Total Cost''' || $3,750\n|-\n|'''Inputs''' || 10x [[bauxite]]\n|-\n|'''Outputs''' || 3x [[aluminum]]\n|-\n|'''Production interval''' || 25 seconds\n|-\n|'''Production/Min''' || 7.2x [[aluminum]]\n|-\n|'''Profit/Min''' || $28.80\n|-\n|'''Profit/Hour''' || $1728.00\n|-\n|'''Return On Investment''' || 0.704%\n|-\n|'''Aliases'''||aluminum factory, aluminumfactory,<br/> aluminum fac\n|}\n[[Category:Facility]]\n\nThe aluminum factory is a facility that produces 3x [[aluminum]] every 25 seconds.\n\nYou need 1/4 of a [[Bauxite mine]] to fully sustain this.\n\n== Related facilities ==\n'''As construction material'''\n*[[Glass factory]]\n*[[CPU factory]]\n*[[Cell phone factory]]\n*[[Laptop factory]]\n*[[Research chemical factory]]\n*[[Solar power plant]]\n*[[Digital camera factory]]\n*[[Television factory]]\n*[[Logistics center]]\n*[[Prescription drug factory]]\n*[[Retail store]]\n*[[Customer support center]]",
